dosingFrequency:
Participants will receive magrolimab intravenous (IV) infusion + nab-paclitaxel IV or paclitaxel IV as mentioned below:

* Magrolimab 1 mg/kg on Cycle 1 Day 1; 30 mg/kg, on Cycle 1 Days 8, 15, 22, Cycle 2 Days 1, 8, 15, 22 and Cycle 3 Days 1 and 15 onwards for every 28-days cycle;
* Nab-paclitaxel 100 mg/m\^2 or paclitaxel 90 mg/m\^2 on Days 1, 8 and 15 of every 28-days cycle.

* N=20 (planned);
* Metastatic CRC previously treated with ≥ 2 lines of prior systematic chemotherapies
* Galinpepimut-S + Montanide + GM-CSF + pembrolizumab

In Dose Escalation: INKmune therapy will be administered by a slow intravenous injection via conventional blood giving set. Approximately 18 patients will receive 3 weekly IV doses of INKmune on Day 1, 8, and 15 as per the below:

* In Cohort 1, the initial planned dose is 1 x 10\^8 INKmune;
* In Cohort 2, the weekly dose will increase to 3 x 10\^8 INKmune;
* In Cohort 3, the weekly dose will increase to 5 x 10\^8 INKmune.

